# Fine-grained personal access token with READ-ONLY access to public repositories
# (GitHub > Settings > Developer settings > Fine-grained tokens; no permissions needed beyond public read).
# Server-only: never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_. Add it in Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables.
# Optional locally: without it the API allows 60 requests/hour, and the site falls back to the local snapshot.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Your Formspree form ID, from https://formspree.io (the part after /f/ in the endpoint URL).
# Leave empty to fall back to a mailto: link.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
# Production URL, used for canonical URLs, sitemap and Open Graph.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://aparnaa-shanmuganathan.vercel.app
